WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.340
Ideas are everywhere.

00:01.960 --> 00:05.540
In homes, on commutes, at 2 a.m.

00:05.780 --> 00:07.760
And most ideas die there.

00:07.900 --> 00:09.480
Not because they weren't good enough.

00:09.640 --> 00:12.460
Building was just too hard.

00:12.820 --> 00:14.280
Until today.

00:14.660 --> 00:16.240
This is Lovable.

00:16.460 --> 00:19.840
The AI app builder that turns ideas into reality.

00:20.500 --> 00:22.020
Anything you can imagine.

00:22.320 --> 00:24.920
From small side projects to enterprise tools.

00:25.280 --> 00:27.600
From consumer apps to platforms at scale.

00:27.940 --> 00:28.740
Built in minutes.

00:30.000 --> 00:31.880
This isn't just a mock-up or a demo.

00:32.120 --> 00:35.260
It's a real working product with authentication,

00:36.120 --> 00:39.000
a database, and built-in security.

00:39.500 --> 00:41.720
Want to change something? Just tell Lovable.

00:42.200 --> 00:45.460
Or jump in and fine-tune it yourself with visual edits.

00:46.120 --> 00:50.100
Add powerful features from payments to AI.

00:52.920 --> 00:55.500
Everything you need, all in one place.
